			"Message": "chore(Element): Synchronize 3 core submodules for diagnostics and build refresh\n\nUpdate the `Element` submodule to integrate targeted enhancements in the extension host pipeline and service layer.\n\n**Cocoon**: Regenerate TypeScript compilation outputs and update the `RouteManifest` timestamp to align the extension host sidecar with the latest source modifications.\n**Output**: Enhance the `RuntimeDiagnosticsInner` transform to explicitly invoke `acquireVsCodeApi` at runtime, validating method signatures (`postMessage`, `getState`, `setState`) and reporting results via `VSCODE_API_TEST` to address WKWebView structural issues.\n**Wind**: Refresh auto-generated command and service catalogs to match the latest upstream VS Code workbench definitions (546 commands, 490 services).\n\nThese changes ensure robust extension host connectivity diagnostics and consistent service layer contracts across the multi-process architecture.",
