				125,
				6
			],
			"Message": "docs(Project): Standardize documentation links and synchronize Element architecture\n\nAlign all GitHub documentation links in `Documentation/GitHub/` to point to component-specific repositories (e.g., `CodeEditorLand/Mountain`, `CodeEditorLand/Cocoon`) instead of the monolithic `Land` repository, ensuring accurate cross-referencing for the distributed component architecture.\n\nReformat tables in `InterComponentProtocol`, `RustInfrastructure`, and `Workflow` documents to improve column alignment and readability, while enforcing strict PascalCase for component names and code styling for technical terms. Correct path references in workflow diagrams to match the new repository structure.\n\nSynchronize the `Element` submodule to include these standardized `Architecture.md` updates across all 14 core components. Additionally, integrate critical runtime patches from the submodule update: a wildcard font-src CSP injection in `Cocoon` and `Output` to resolve font loading failures in macOS WKWebView, and a bracket notation refactoring in `Sky` to enforce strict TypeScript compliance.\n\nThese changes ensure the technical reference accurately reflects the decentralized repository structure and resolves webview rendering issues for extensions relying on custom fonts.",
			"SHA": "c8dd74b4d967168929cbc51d2664845fc1c83b3b"
		},
